    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are adept at greasing the palms of contacts to minimize the amount of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bribe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bribe\">Bribe</a> normally required.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Haggle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Haggle\">Haggle</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bribery\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bribery\">Bribery</a> applications of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> skill, you reduce the DC to reduce the price of the item haggled over by 10.</p>",
